Package: ecasim
Title: External Control Arm Construction with Propensity Score Methods
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "RWE",
           family = "Demo",
           email = "rwe-demo@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Educational R package illustrating how to build an external
    control arm (ECA) from synthetic real-world data to contextualize a
    single-arm early-phase oncology trial. Provides utilities to simulate
    a confounded EHR-like cohort, fit a propensity score model, perform
    nearest-neighbor matching and inverse probability of treatment
    weighting (IPTW), and estimate a treatment effect on a time-to-event
    endpoint via Cox proportional hazards. Designed to support a
    reproducible Quarto analysis report suitable for regulated review
    contexts (e.g., FDA, EMA).
